## PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Upgrade the existing **Serendib Reserve (https://serendibreserve.com/)** website into a premium, fully functional international gemstone auction platform.

I have provided a UI reference image showing the desired design direction. Use this image as the main visual reference for the new auction experience.

**IMPORTANT:**
- This is an improvement to an EXISTING developed website, not a completely new project.
- First inspect the existing codebase, framework, components, routing, database, authentication and backend architecture.
- Preserve the existing website's identity, branding, functionality, pages and established design wherever possible.
- Do not delete or unnecessarily rewrite existing working features.
- Integrate the new auction functionality into the existing architecture.
- All frontend and backend features must work together. Do not create a static UI demonstration.
- Implement real database operations, authentication, real-time updates and secure server-side validation.

The final result should feel like a premium international gemstone auction marketplace originating from Sri Lanka.

